CHIMERA — Agency Composition Engine.

This connects directly to what we built in Pantheon: the Cognitive Morphology Engine, the Ensemble Orchestrator, Kintsugi, and the idea of intelligence as a collection of interoperable capabilities.

The key distinction is that we don’t need to reproduce an entire mind to reproduce a useful cognitive function.

We can model a function from observable behavior, isolate it, connect it to other functions, and test the resulting system.

